#               docs/math/supervisor/emergent-supervision-from-
#               geometry.md §5.5 (Mara `a3dec7b`; the H4 empirical
#               DEFER flag this fracture body inherits),
#               docs/audits/2026-07-03-seam-restart-intensity-
#               shard.md (Seam audit `f732d9c`; the audit that
#               named this bilateral pair as next-/loop tick).
# Substrate decisions: [[architecture-property-fracture-bilateral]]
#                       (#53; this is the fourth instance),
#                      [[architecture-shards-as-substrate-source]],
#                      [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]],
